WEBVTT


00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:36.236
[whistling]


00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:03.068
[Winnie the Pooh theme song]


00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:13.231
[male narrator] This could be
the room of any small boy.


00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:15.749
But, in fact, it's not.


00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:21.039
It is the room of one young boy
in particular named Christopher Robin.


00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:24.157
Now, Christopher Robin
has a very active imagination,


00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:27.710
not to mention the uncanny ability
to collect things.


00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:31.190
Big things. Small things. Sticky things.


00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:34.955
But his favourite things
are his stuffed animals.


00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:37.445
Ah! There they are now.


00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:41.603
A charming and eccentric
cast of characters.


00:01:41.690 --> 00:01:46.559
And his best friend among them
is a bear named Winnie the Pooh.


00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:49.118
Or Pooh for short.


00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:52.885
Together they had many
unusual adventures,


00:01:52.970 --> 00:01:57.088
that all happened right here
in the Hundred Acre Wood.


00:01:58.850 --> 00:02:03.002
♪ Deep in the Hundred Acre Wood


00:02:03.090 --> 00:02:07.800
♪ Where Christopher Robin plays


00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:12.725
♪ You'll find the enchanted
neighbourhood


00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:17.930
♪ Of Christopher's childhood days


00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:21.685
♪ A donkey named Eeyore is his friend


00:02:22.210 --> 00:02:25.919
♪ And Kanga and little Roo
and Tigger, too


00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:30.601
♪ There's Rabbit and Piglet
and there's Owl


00:02:30.690 --> 00:02:33.648
♪ But most of all Winnie the Pooh


00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:38.203
♪ Winnie the Pooh
Winnie the Pooh


00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:40.884
♪ Tubby little cubby
all stuffed with fluff


00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:44.406
♪ He's Winnie the Pooh
Winnie the Pooh


00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:47.766
♪ Willy-nilly silly old bear


00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:51.328
♪ Winnie the Pooh
Winnie the Pooh


00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:53.401
♪ Tubby little cubby
all stuffed with fluff


00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:56.687
♪ He's Winnie the Pooh
Winnie the Pooh


00:02:56.770 --> 00:03:00.206
♪ Willy-nilly silly old bear ♪


00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:01.609
[narrator] Chapter one,


00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:06.480
in which Winnie the Pooh
has a very important thing to do.


00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:09.482
As the sun rose over
the Hundred Acre Wood,


00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:13.802
Pooh leapt out of bed and greeted
the day with much enthusiasm.


00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:15.403
[snoring] Ooh...


00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:19.802
- Honey.
- [narrator] Uh, Pooh?


00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:22.962
[stammers] More honey, please.


00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:24.608
[humming]


00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:26.203
I say, Pooh?


00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:29.520
- [continues snoring]
- [clears throat] Pooh?


00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:32.841
Oh, do wake up.


00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:35.529
- Pooh!
- [Pooh] Oh!


00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:43.604
Oh, bother. I was having
the most wonderful dream.


00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:45.920
Yes, but it's time to wake up.


00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:49.844
You have a very important thing
to do today.


00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:53.240
- Like what?
- [chuckles] Well, if I told you that,


00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:55.685
I'd ruin the rest of the story,
wouldn't I?


00:03:55.770 --> 00:03:58.443
- [tummy rumbles]
- [giggles]


00:03:58.530 --> 00:03:59.929
Of course.


00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:04.447
What could be more important
than a little something to eat?


00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:09.320
Or perhaps a little larger something.


00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:13.722
Oh, not to worry, tummy.
I always know what to do.


00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:16.961
♪ A Pooh Bear takes care of his tummy


00:04:17.050 --> 00:04:20.326
♪ He fills it with things that are sweet


00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:23.686
♪ A Pooh Bear takes care of his tummy


00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:27.080
- ♪ By never forgetting to eat
- [tummy rumbles in tune]


00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:32.483
♪ When it is growly and glummy
a search for the honey is on


00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:35.888
♪ The Pooh has a knack
for finding a snack


00:04:35.970 --> 00:04:38.928
♪ Unless all the honey is...


00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:40.363
Gone?


00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:42.486
[tummy rumbling in tune]


00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:45.004
♪ A Pooh Bear takes care of his tummy


00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:46.887
♪ No need for the tummy to fret


00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:49.640
♪ A Pooh Bear takes care of his tummy


00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:51.766
♪ He knows what his tummy must get


00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:54.405
♪ Don't worry, my round little chummy


00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:56.720
♪ I'm hearing your ravenous plea


00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:59.085
♪ When there is no honey
the Pooh takes the tummy


00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:01.400
♪ Wherever the honey will be


00:05:01.490 --> 00:05:03.765
♪ My friends are out there
with honey to spare


00:05:03.850 --> 00:05:08.878
♪ And they will take care
of my tummy and me ♪


00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:15.326
- Bother.
- [Eeyore groans]


00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:18.049
[gasps] I know that sigh.


00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:21.440
Good morning, Eeyore.


00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:23.521
Lovely day, isn't it?


00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:26.966
Wish I could say yes, but I can't.


00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:28.244
Oh my, Eeyore.


00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:32.005
You wouldn't happen to have any honey
lying about, would you?


00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:35.844
- You see, I seem to have run out.
- [tummy continues to rumble]


00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:38.239
Oh, yes. Good idea, tummy.


00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:41.128
Perhaps I should look in back.


00:05:42.090 --> 00:05:45.878
Bother. No honey in here, either.


00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:47.323
What?


00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:50.880
Eeyore, what has happened to your tail?


00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:53.006
- What has happened to it?
- Well...


00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:56.440
...it isn't there.


00:05:57.210 --> 00:06:01.089
That accounts for a good deal.
That explains everything.


00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:02.922
No wonder.


00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:04.519
[sighs]


00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:08.400
Oh! There it is.
I'd recognize it anywhere.


00:06:08.490 --> 00:06:10.321
The very tree where I was hatched.


00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:12.480
I remember the day
Mother made these marks,


00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:16.848
her giant meaty claw carving furrows
in the crumbly bark.


00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:19.683
Chapter one, the birth of a genius.


00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:21.647
Pardon me, Owl. What are you doing?


00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:24.198
Hmm? Oh, hello, Pooh. Eeyore.


00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:27.441
Why, I'm penning my personal memoirs.


00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:29.839
[chuckling] Yes. Now, where was I?


00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:32.046
Oh, yes, of course. With steely nerve...


00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:35.645
Perhaps you could take a short break
from your important work


00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:38.528
and help us find Eeyore's tail?


00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:40.999
...and I rocketed towards Eeyore's tail!


00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:42.762
Eeyore's tail?


00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:44.169
What's wrong with Eeyore's tail?


00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:46.002
Well, it isn't there.


00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:47.967
Yes. So I see.


00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:49.608
Won't you help us, Owl?


00:06:49.690 --> 00:06:53.968
You have such a talent for speaking
and telling us what to do.


00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:57.838
Oh, thank you, Pooh. Yes, I do, don't I?
I didn't think anyone noticed.


00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:00.239
All right, take this.
Write this down carefully.


00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:04.039
Now, the customary procedure
in such cases is as follows.


00:07:04.130 --> 00:07:05.449
[Pooh, interrupting Owl] Excuse me, Owl,


00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:10.240
but what does
"Crustimoney Proseedcake" mean?


00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:15.165
For I am a bear of very little brain
and long words bother me.


00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:17.525
It means "the thing to do."


00:07:17.610 --> 00:07:20.841
Oh. Well, as long as it means that,
I don't mind.


00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:23.160
- [sighs]
- [coughs]


00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:26.799
All right. Yes, well,
the thing to do is as follows:


00:07:26.890 --> 00:07:28.289
First, issue a reward to the...


00:07:28.370 --> 00:07:30.486
- [Pooh] Gesundheit.
- I beg your pardon?


00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:33.243
Well, you sneezed
just as you were going to tell me


00:07:33.330 --> 00:07:35.764
what the first thing to do was.


00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:37.408
I didn't sneeze.


00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:40.843
No, you did, Owl.


00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:43.808
No, I didn't. You can't sneeze
without knowing it.


00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:47.849
Well, you can't know it without
something having been sneezed.


00:07:49.890 --> 00:07:51.005
As I was saying,


00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:54.048
- first, issue a reward.
- [Pooh whispers] He's doing it again.


00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:56.200
You must be catching a cold.


00:07:56.290 --> 00:07:58.520
I'll probably catch it, too.


00:07:58.610 --> 00:08:02.398
No, no, no! I'm not catching a cold.


00:08:02.490 --> 00:08:05.482
The word is "issue," not "achoo",


00:08:05.570 --> 00:08:07.208
and "achoo" isn't even a word.


00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:09.326
It's just a sort of sneezy sound
like achoo!


00:08:09.410 --> 00:08:11.128
[Pooh] Perhaps you should lie down, Owl?


00:08:11.210 --> 00:08:14.168
- Oh!
- My throat feels a little scratchy.


00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:16.525
Open wide, please.


00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:18.729
Ahh.


00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:20.448
Just as I suspected.


00:08:20.530 --> 00:08:23.602
Owl, we need honey.


00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:26.250
Enough of this infernal folderol!


00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:29.845
Look, the thing to do is,
we write a notice


00:08:29.930 --> 00:08:32.398
promising a large something


00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:36.768
to anyone who finds
a replacement tail for Eeyore!


00:08:36.850 --> 00:08:38.078
Is that clear?


00:08:38.170 --> 00:08:41.879
That sounds like a wonderful plan, Owl.


00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:45.919
Excellent. Now, we shall get Christopher
Robin to write out the notices,


00:08:46.010 --> 00:08:48.604
and we'll put them up
all over the forest.


00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:53.279
Here you are, Pooh.


00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:57.366
Oh, and make sure everyone can see them.


00:08:57.450 --> 00:08:59.247
Oh, I will, Christopher.


00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:02.879
♪ Come one, come two, come all
Everyone heed the call


00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:06.246
♪ There's a very important thing to do


00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:09.168
♪ Drop what you're doing and come


00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:10.649
♪ Bumpity-bumpity-bum


00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:13.802
♪ There's a very important thing to do


00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:18.729
♪ It's time to gather 'round
The work has just begun


00:09:18.810 --> 00:09:20.880
♪ And when it's done
then you'll have found


00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:22.244
♪ That you have had some fun


00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:24.719
♪ With a monumentuous, consequentuous


00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:27.483
♪ Very important thing to do ♪


00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:30.199
[grunts]


00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:34.329
There we are.


00:09:34.410 --> 00:09:36.640
And now, I shall return to...


00:09:36.730 --> 00:09:38.004
Oh!


00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:40.046
Hello, B'loon.


00:09:40.130 --> 00:09:43.088
We have a very important
thing to do today.


00:09:43.170 --> 00:09:44.489
- Oh, yes.
- [low growling]


00:09:44.570 --> 00:09:46.322
Perhaps you'd like to join us?


00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:50.483
- Poor Eeyore. He's lost his tail.
- [shouting]


00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:53.448
Consider yourself pounced.


00:09:54.090 --> 00:09:56.604
That was a close call there, Pooh Bear.


00:09:56.690 --> 00:09:58.681
This guy... and I'm talking to you...


00:09:58.770 --> 00:10:00.681
...he was sneaking up on ya.


00:10:00.770 --> 00:10:01.759
Whoo! Oh!


00:10:01.850 --> 00:10:04.444
A slippery little devil, eh?
Get back here!


00:10:04.530 --> 00:10:08.079
Oh, no, you don't. Come here. Whoo!


00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:12.329
Well, I must have scared him off.


00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:14.162
Um... Tigger?


00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:16.047
Yes, my good man?


00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:18.762
[stammers]


00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:19.919
Why, you.


00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:21.921
Here, take some of that! What is this?


00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:25.559
Oh, really? Sticking to me now. [shouts]


00:10:25.650 --> 00:10:29.689
This isn't working out the way
I was hoping. Make him go away.


00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:30.885
Oh, dear.


00:10:30.970 --> 00:10:32.608
[sobs] Get him off of me!


00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:36.922
Is he still there?


00:10:37.010 --> 00:10:39.399
Oh, yes. He's still here.


00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:42.004
And I think he wants to stick with you.


00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:43.125
What?


00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:46.603
I never thought of having
a sidekick before.


00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:51.969
I got to admit, he is a handsome devil.
Look at the chin on this kid.


00:10:52.050 --> 00:10:55.565
No, no. I can't do it, I tell you.
It's too risky.


00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:58.323
Why, if something were to happen
to this little guy,


00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:01.368
I just couldn't live with myself.


00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:06.285
It's a dangerous path I bounce.
But I bounce it alone.


00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:09.601
Because the Hundred Acre Wood
needs a hero, Pooh Bear,


00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:12.409
and I'm the only one.


00:11:13.530 --> 00:11:15.521
♪ Oh, I'm bouncy,
trouncy, flouncy, pouncy


00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:16.679
♪ Fun, fun, fun, fun, fun!


00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:18.089
♪ But the most wonderful thing
about Tiggers is


00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:20.889
♪ I'm the only one
I'm the only one! ♪


00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:22.323
Hoo-hoo-hoo-hoo!


00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:23.604
[chattering]


00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:25.840
Attention, please. Attention.


00:11:25.930 --> 00:11:29.605
Something tragic has befallen
a member of our community.


00:11:29.690 --> 00:11:33.569
- [all gasp]
- I present to you: Exhibit A.


00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:37.327
Oh! That is tragic.


00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:40.163
What? Oh, no, no, no.


00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:42.366
Eeyore, will you turn around, please?


00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:44.122
Oops, sorry.


00:11:44.210 --> 00:11:47.998
Our dear friend Eeyore
has lost his tail.


00:11:48.090 --> 00:11:49.079
Oh, dear.


00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:52.964
We mustn't leave him in this condition.


00:11:53.050 --> 00:11:57.566
So, we will have a contest
to find a new tail for Eeyore.


00:11:57.650 --> 00:12:01.040
[clears throat] I do say, Christopher
Robin, the winners of such contest


00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:05.169
are traditionally awarded
some form of remuneration.


00:12:06.010 --> 00:12:10.083
What is a "remooner"...
Moonyour... A renew...


00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:12.604
What are we renumbering?


00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:15.124
I don't know, Pooh,
but it sounds like a good thing.


00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:17.280
Oh, yes, it is a good thing, Piglet.


00:12:17.370 --> 00:12:20.043
It's a prize. But what shall it be?


00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:22.769
How about something great,
like a firecracker!


00:12:22.850 --> 00:12:24.442
Oh, gracious, no.


00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:26.885
How about something nice,
like a warm hug?


00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:28.881
Pruning shears. I need pruning shears.


00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:33.043
I'd say thistles,
but nobody listens to me, anyway.


00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:39.126
Oh, Christopher Robin, I was hoping
for something a bit... sweeter?


00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:43.447
Why, Pooh, that's a grand idea.


00:12:44.010 --> 00:12:47.685
The prize for a new tail shall be...
a pot of honey.


00:12:47.770 --> 00:12:49.123
[all cheer] Hooray!


00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:52.810
[narrator] As the others
searched for a tail,


00:12:52.890 --> 00:12:57.645
Pooh realized that a pine cone
would not win him the honey.


00:12:57.730 --> 00:12:58.719
Why not?


00:12:58.810 --> 00:13:01.563
Because it would have to be
something special.


00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:05.882
Oh. Special, you say. Special.


00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:07.801
Think, think, think.


00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:10.358
No hurry, Pooh. Just take your time.


00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:14.682
Take my time. What a wonderful idea.


00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:17.209
Cuckoo, cuckoo.


00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:19.850
- Thanks, Pooh.
- Congratulations.


00:13:19.930 --> 00:13:21.841
You've won the contest.


00:13:21.930 --> 00:13:23.966
♪ It's Pooh


00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:26.803
♪ It's Pooh
Pooh wins the honey pot


00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:28.767
♪ Found a tail for his friend


00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:30.329
♪ Now it's on my rear end


00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:33.243
♪ You get the honey
Enjoy ♪


00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:34.968
[crashing]


00:13:35.770 --> 00:13:39.160
I knew it was too good to be true.


00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:41.002
Oh, dear.


00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:43.001
Well, rules are rules. So sorry, Pooh.


00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:47.879
Excuse me. We could give B'loon a try!


00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:51.360
- Whoa! [giggles]
- How clever, Piglet.


00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:53.202
What do you think, Eeyore?


00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:57.408
Sure is a cheerful colour.
Guess I'll have to get used to it.


00:13:57.490 --> 00:14:00.687
♪ It's Piglet
It's Piglet


00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:02.681
♪ Piglet wins the honey pot


00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:04.442
♪ Takes the prize fair and square


00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:06.088
I'm still a bit up in the air.


00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:09.719
♪ You get the honey
Enjoy ♪


00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:13.086
Hmm. This may not work after all.


00:14:15.570 --> 00:14:16.889
[sighs]


00:14:16.970 --> 00:14:19.643
[narrator] And so they tried
a great many things.


00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:21.679
They tried...


00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:24.884
...and they tried...


00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:27.844
...and they tried...


00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:33.129
...and they tried, and they tried
and tried, and they tried...


00:14:34.610 --> 00:14:36.009
...until...


00:14:36.090 --> 00:14:37.921
[accordion makes sombre music]


00:14:38.010 --> 00:14:41.400
...they had run out of things to try.


00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:45.199
It's OK. I'll learn to live without it.


00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:47.520
Poor dear.


00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:52.210
You know, I may have just the thing.


00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:53.643
Up, up, up you go.


00:14:53.730 --> 00:14:55.243
[humming]


00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:56.729
There you are.


00:14:56.810 --> 00:15:02.043
It's an awful nice tail, Kanga.
Much nicer than the rest of me.


00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:04.086
♪ It's Kanga


00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:07.640
No! No, no, no, no.
How about we celebrate with silence?


00:15:07.730 --> 00:15:09.766
♪ Enjoy ♪


00:15:09.850 --> 00:15:11.044
Oh, bother.


00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:14.848
My tummy is feeling
a little 11 o'clock-ish.


00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:17.319
Do you still tell the time,
clock friend?


00:15:17.410 --> 00:15:21.119
I can't tell by the expression
on your face.


00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:27.084
[narrator] Pooh left feeling unsatisfied
and a little out of sorts.


00:15:27.170 --> 00:15:30.640
In fact, he was so distracted
by his rumbly tummy,


00:15:30.730 --> 00:15:34.769
that he didn't notice that he was
walking onto the next paragraph.


00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:36.681
What is a paragraph?


00:15:36.770 --> 00:15:40.558
It's a group of sentences
that form a complete thought.


00:15:41.650 --> 00:15:44.244
Is there honey in this paragraph?


00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:46.844
Oh, sorry, Pooh, no.


00:15:46.930 --> 00:15:50.002
Well, then I don't find it very useful.


00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:52.762
What's that, Pooh?


00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:57.526
I'm not sure. I shall follow it
to see where it leads.


00:15:58.530 --> 00:16:01.044
Eeyore, your tail!


00:16:01.130 --> 00:16:05.248
Yep. Unravelled.
Guess I'm back where I started.


00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:07.366
[Pooh] I'm sorry, Eeyore.


00:16:07.450 --> 00:16:09.680
Such a nice tail, too.


00:16:09.770 --> 00:16:13.968
No matter.
All good things come to an end.


00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:18.760
Oh. Oh! Eeyore, if you... [grunting]


00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:23.206
Oh, my goodness.
This story is going too fast!


00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:25.246
[grunts, sighs]


00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:28.800
