- Thank you. Thank you.


00:17:32.410 --> 00:17:33.968
Yes, it is quite clever, isn't it?


00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:37.201
T-A-E-L. Yes. Perfect.


00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:38.928
Well, hello there, Owl.


00:17:39.010 --> 00:17:43.288
